    <string name="about_license_body">lightmux is free and open source software released under the MIT License.\n\nCopyright (c) 2026 ninvfeng</string>
    <string name="about_notice_title">Notice · terminal-emulator / terminal-view</string>
    <string name="about_notice_body">This product includes software developed as part of the Termux project.\n\nThe terminal core (terminal-emulator) and renderer (terminal-view) are vendored from termux/termux-app v0.118.0 and derive from Terminal Emulator for Android, Copyright (C) Jack Palevich and contributors. Both modules are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full license text ships inside this app at assets/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt and is available at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n\nModifications by lightmux, all marked with a [lightmux] comment: terminal-emulator drops the local PTY JNI code, adds TerminalTransport (an abstract byte channel) and rewrites TerminalSession to drive a transport instead of a forked process, adding reconnect() so a dropped connection can be replaced while the emulator and its scrollback are preserved. terminal-view is unmodified.\n\nNo GPL-licensed code from termux-app is included in this application.</string>
    <string name="about_dependencies_title">其他组件</string>
    <string name="about_dependencies_body">sshj — Apache-2.0 · SSH 传输与 SFTP\nBouncy Castle — Bouncy Castle License（MIT 风格）· 加密算法\nEdDSA-Java — CC0-1.0 · ed25519 密钥\nAndroidX / Jetpack Compose / Material 3 — Apache-2.0\nKotlin 标准库与协程 — Apache-2.0\n\nJetBrains Mono — SIL Open Font License 1.1 · 内置终端字体\nCopyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono)\n完整许可文本随 APK 分发，位于 assets/licenses/JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt，亦见 https://scripts.sil.org/OFL\n字体文件原样内置未作修改；CJK 字符走系统字体回退。</string>

